      "pages": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "text": "The budget speech sets out the civic programme for Bengaluru for financial year 2024–25. It separates approved allocations from expenditure reported later in the year."
        },
        {
          "page": 18,
          "text": "The record sets aside ₹1,500 crore for road, footpath and junction safety works in 2024–25. This is an allocation; it is not evidence that the full amount has already been spent."
        }
      ],
