      "pages": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "text": "The action plan assigns primary collection and segregation responsibilities to ward-level service teams and requires monthly reporting to the civic authority."
        },
        {
          "page": 11,
          "text": "Households are asked to separate wet, dry and domestic hazardous waste at source. The plan records 198 ward-level reporting units for the programme."
        }
