      "pages": [
        {
          "page": 6,
          "text": "The climate action plan proposes a 15 percent reduction in municipal transport emissions by 2030 relative to the baseline year. The target is a proposal and requires annual measurement."
        },
        {
          "page": 31,
          "text": "Priority actions include safer walking routes, bus priority and shade along high-use streets. The document does not establish a parcel-specific construction right."
        }
      ],
      "page_hash": "ffe6bf4b79cf0b722ce1579a9340ec078ac123d83be084742415626885b64e80"
    },
