          "text": "The road safety programme prioritises junction redesign, speed management and continuous footpaths around schools and transit stations."
        },
        {
          "page": 15,
          "text": "A ward may receive a safety treatment after a site audit and an approved work order. A programme listing alone does not confirm that construction has started."
        }
